'''Ghostly Houseguests''' (あの世からの帰省ラッシュ！, ''Anoyo kara no Kishōrasshu!'', '''Homecoming Rush from that World!''') is the August event of [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]].

==Event==
In the heat of summer... the spirits grow restless... and the veil between our world and the afterlife grows thin...<br>
It's up to your Cats to send your "Ghostly Houseguests" packing to finish the summer in peace!<br>
Visit the Legend Stages to challenge the limited monthly stage "Ghostly Houseguests"!<br>
Fight off spectral menaces like Lord Enma and the Ectogang and you might earn a new ally to fight alongside you!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''This event starts the 1st of August and continues until the 1st of September'''}}

Get a chance to unlock Vengeful Cat upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a 100% chance to collect rewards by using the Treasure Radar item!)

※ After you have picked up Vengeful Cat, unlock it at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Vengeful Cat from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.<br>
※If stages for this event do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

